OL,5,G0300 Castle
OL,6,     FOne of Esposito's old cases is
OL,7,     Freexamined by Castle and Beckett
OL,8,     Fbecause of a clue left at a crime
OL,9,     Fscene involving an armoured car
OL,10,     Fdriver's murder.
OL,11,G0345 The Highland..
OL,12,     F...Vet. Fiona treats a German
OL,13,     FShepherd with one of the worst
OL,14,     Fanal infections she has ever seen;
OL,15,     FKatie treats a pregnant ewe that
OL,16,     Fhas been pecked by crows.
OL,17,G0430 The Highland..
OL,18,     F...Vet. Katie must decide which
OL,19,     Fpet to prioritise when a dog and a
OL,20,     Fcat are rushed to the practice; a
OL,21,     Ffarmer brings in his newborn calf;
OL,22,     FTom visits a stable near Wick.
